# derived from their MaxQuant output is not redistributed (../MANIFEST.tsv redistribution = checksum_only).
# Rebuild it with scripts/43d_stage_pclap.py.
pclap_mullari2017_peptides.tsv
# RBDmap (PRIDE PXD000883): likewise only the EMBL-EBI terms of use, so the peptide table derived from its MaxQuant
# peptide and quantification tables is not redistributed (checksum_only). Rebuild it with
# scripts/43f_stage_peptide_backgrounds.py --only rbdmap.
rbdmap_castello2016_measured_peptides.tsv
